{"sha": "bbeeaf88e0f23f338bc075489da33eaad606483eb15c2528ab98d5323ebef515", "body": ["\\textbf{24.} 核的矩：$\\int g_t = 1$（取第 7 题中的 $f = g_s$，", "或直接由高斯积分），$\\int", "x\\,g_t(x)\\dd x = 0$（被积函数为奇函数），并作代换 $x =", "2\\sqrt t\\,v$，", "\\[", "\\int_\\R x^2g_t(x)\\,\\dd x", "= \\frac{4t}{\\sqrt\\pi}\\int_\\R v^2\\eu^{-v^2}\\dd v = 2t .", "\\]", "在卷积中作代换 $x = z + y$，并注意", "$\\iint(\\abs z + \\abs y)^2g_t(z)f(y)\\,\\dd z\\,\\dd y < \\infty$", "（$\\int\\abs z^kg_t$ 与 $\\int\\abs y^kf$ 均对 $k", "\\leq 2$，利用 $\\abs y \\leq \\frac{1 + y^2}2$），富比尼", "定理与托内利定理可用于下列矩积分：", "\\[", "\\int x\\,u(t,x)\\dd x = \\iint (z + y)\\,g_t(z)f(y)\\,\\dd z\\,\\dd", "y = 0\\cdot\\!\\int\\! f + 1\\cdot\\!\\int\\! yf(y)\\dd y,", "\\]", "即第一个结论；另有", "\\[", "\\iint (z+y)^2g_t(z)f(y)\\,\\dd z\\,\\dd y", "= 2t\\int f + 2\\cdot0\\cdot\\!\\int\\! yf + \\int y^2f(y)\\dd y ,", "\\]", "即第二个结论。均值可加，方差可加，且核", "的均值为 $0$、方差为 $2t$：经过时间 $t$ 后", "热量已扩散开，宽度量级为 $\\sqrt{2t}$ ---", "距离随时间的平方根增长，这正是", "扩散的特征（布朗路径也具有此性质，", "见\\cref{ch:b3:probability}）。", "", "\\textbf{25.} 变换一侧：$\\hat f(\\xi) =", "\\sqrt\\pi\\,\\eu^{-\\xi^2/4}$，于是 $\\hat u(t,\\xi) =", "\\sqrt\\pi\\,\\eu^{-(t + \\frac14)\\xi^2}$，它是", "$(1 + 4t)^{-1/2}\\exp\\bigl(-x^2/(1+4t)\\bigr)$ 的变换（由", "高斯变换表 $\\eu^{-ax^2} \\mapsto", "\\sqrt{\\pi/a}\\,\\eu^{-\\xi^2/4a}$，其中 $a = \\frac1{1+4t}$）：", "即闭形式。直接验算，记 $\\sigma = 1 + 4t$：", "\\[", "\\partial_tu = \\sigma^{-1/2}\\eu^{-x^2/\\sigma}", "\\Bigl(-\\frac2\\sigma + \\frac{4x^2}{\\sigma^2}\\Bigr)", "= \\partial^2_{xx}u ,", "\\]", "两边均由 $\\partial_xu =", "-\\frac{2x}\\sigma\\,u$ 算得。守恒：$\\int u(t) =", "\\sigma^{-1/2}\\sqrt{\\pi\\sigma} = \\sqrt\\pi$ 对一切 $t$ 成立。", "耗散：", "\\[", "\\norm{u(t)}_2^2 = \\frac1\\sigma\\int\\eu^{-2x^2/\\sigma}\\dd x", "= \\frac1\\sigma\\sqrt{\\frac{\\pi\\sigma}2}", "= \\sqrt{\\frac\\pi2}\\,(1+4t)^{-1/2},", "\\]", "于是 $\\norm{u(t)}_2 = (\\pi/2)^{1/4}(1+4t)^{-1/4}$，", "非增，对数为凸（第 23 题）；", "$L^2$ 范数以 $t^{-1/4}$ 的速率衰减，恰为", "$t^{-1/2}$ 指数的一半（该指数即 $\\norm{u(t)}_\\infty$ 的衰减指数） ---这与", "$\\norm u_2^2 \\leq \\norm u_\\infty\\norm u_1$ 以及", "$\\norm u_1$ 的守恒性相一致。方差：$\\int x^2u(t) =", "\\frac1\\sigma\\cdot\\frac{\\sigma^{3/2}\\sqrt\\pi}2 =", "\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2\\,(1 + 4t) = \\int x^2f + 2t\\sqrt\\pi$，与", "第 24 题的预测相符（$\\int x^2f = \\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2$，$\\int", "f = \\sqrt\\pi$）。取 $t = 6$，$\\sigma = 25$，峰值高度", "为 $u(6, 0) = \\frac15$（对比 $u(0,0) = 1$），宽度尺度", "为初值宽度的 $\\sqrt\\sigma = 5$ 倍，而 $\\int u =", "\\sqrt\\pi \\approx 1.7725$ 始终成立：光斑", "高度降为原来的五分之一，宽度增为原来的五倍，热量分毫未失。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}